WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.880
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.450
I was taken to this place 
called the Digital World,

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.790
where I met Shoutmon and 
lots of other Digimon.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.060
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
<b>Enemy?                          The battle begins!                      Enemy</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
<b>Team ?   Xros Heart(Team Taiki)               Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
Protagonist                                                          Rival

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.160
<b>Enemy?
Ally?</b>

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.160
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:19.430
A dark power turned Lucemon 
into a ferocious monster.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.430
With Nene captured, 
we had a tough battle to fight,

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.940
but our new flying warrior created 
by a DigiXros with Sparrowmon,

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.610
Shoutmon X5, managed to destroy him.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:35.410
Peace returned once again 
to the Heaven Zone.

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:46.660
<b>Stingmon,</b>

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:46.660
<b>Hero of the Digimon Jungle</b>

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.380
Stingmon, Hero of the Digimon Jungle!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.730
Now we have six Code Crowns.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.380
I wonder what the next 
Zone will be like?

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:01.770
Nene just disappeared...

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.010
I wonder if she's okay.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.980
I'm sure she's fine.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.470
She has a Xros Loader, too.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:11.750
And she had a strong-looking 
Digimon at her side.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.030
I don't know...

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:23.160
Something about that Digimon bothers me.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.620
Like what?

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:25.450
Breaststroke...

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.800
Looks like we're almost there.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.090
Huh?

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.660
A world in the sky again?

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.730
That's two in a row...

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:47.790
Or maybe there's just nothing here?

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.940
Zenjirou, you're...

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:57.880
...afraid of heights, aren't you?

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.530
What about it?

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:05.100
Don't look down.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.470
Down?

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.510
Too high! I'm scared! Too high!

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.980
We're gonna die!

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.070
Get off of me!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.610
I didn't mean you, Cutemon.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:35.090
No fair!

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:36.870
I meant <i>you</i>! Get off!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:38.600
Guys!

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.140
I've got them.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.340
Beelzebumon!

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.020
I hate to interrupt your 
moment of relief, Taiki...

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.880
But what do <i>we</i> do?

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.760
Beelzebumon's the only one with wings!

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.770
Oh, yeah!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.970
Hey! Quit flailing around!

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:25.350
We're done for, Taiki!

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.300
What do we do?! What do 
we do?! What do we do?!

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.440
We'll pull you up, Brother!

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.890
That should stop you... I think!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.190
You boys pull, too!

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.220
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.790
Hey, I've got it!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.120
Everyone, grab on to Dorulumon!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.070
Dorulumon! Starmon! Pickmons!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.600
DigiXros!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.240
Spin your drill, Dorulumon!

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:00.020
You did it, General! I knew you would!

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:06.160
<i>Making an instant helicopter 
from my drill, huh?</i>

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:13.510
<i>I'm glad Cutemon can't see 
me like this, though...</i>

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:21.350
I finally get a turn to act again.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.090
It looks like your subordinates 
are having a hard time.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:26.290
Lord Tactimon is so cool!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.750
So wise, unlike that 
scary Lord Blastmon!

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:30.990
He's wonderful!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:33.040
No good! No good at all!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:38.990
About 40 points. 
I'd give you about 40 points.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:42.000
The Three Head Officers may be strong,

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.520
but their subordinates are useless.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.030
No good! No good at all!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.240
If that's 40 points out of 40, 
there's no problem!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.110
Is that your pet?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.500
Something wrong with that?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.540
I thought he was cute.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.760
No good! They're all no good!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:06.300
People will question your 
character, Lilithmon.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.950
Such a stiff, as always.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.710
Where shall we take our stroll today?

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:15.690
The Forest Zone.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:19.000
Akari! Zenjirou! Can you hear me?

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:23.290
It's no use. 
The Wrister can't reach them.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:26.340
Is this the Forest 
Zone I've heard about?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.540
Huh? Forest Zone?

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.210
It's a jungle world inhabited 
by powerful Digimon.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.170
Even the Bagra Army has been

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.280
keeping clear of this 
place for a long time.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.980
I'm worried about the others.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:44.660
Yeah... I know Beelzebumon 
is with them, but still...

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.020
We can't say for certain that 
the Bagra Army isn't here.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:49.600
Cutemon might be out there crying.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.460
I'm going to look for him.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:51.880
Thanks.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:54.550
I'll send a helper with you... 
A pro at finding things.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.470
Reload, Revolmon!

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.770
You called, Taiki?

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.400
You all stay there!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.730
We're gonna fly, gun man!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.610
Okay!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.380
Something's there.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.490
Something's definitely there.

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:30.700
Doesn't staying here seem 
like a bad idea to you?

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.770
Yeah...

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.840
What is this place?

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:48.400
And why would a Zone entrance 
be all the way up there?

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.920
Just remembering it makes 
me want to not remember it!

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.820
Keep it down!

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.790
Those huge bugs will find us!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.110
Are your injuries okay?

00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:00.210
Sorry about this, Beelzebumon.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.400
Don't worry about it.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.870
It's a Warrior's job to protect the weak.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.520
Who are you?!

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.580
That is my line!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:19.090
I am the guardian of the 
War Cry Forest, Stingmon!

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.890
None may pass beyond this point!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.720
I will eliminate all who 
disturb this sacred ground!

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:45.210
Oh, no!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.710
You're open!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.310
Stop, Stingmon!

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:59.700
Lilamon, why are you 
helping the intruders?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.430
Can't you tell?

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:07.340
These two are clearly a couple in love!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:11.700
W-W-What did you say?!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.040
Aren't you?

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.370
No! No! No!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.180
We're the War Cry Forest's 
soldiers of love.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:21.410
We mustn't hurt those who are in love.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.150
After all, we're...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:28.220
...the most deeply in 
love couple in this Zone!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:34.230
Th-That is not true.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.760
Stingmon, you jerk!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:41.760
Hey, d-don't cry, Lilamon!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.950
Why do you always do this?!

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.740
You're mean!

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:51.090
What happened?

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.210
Looks like it's a truce... for now.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.920
No! It's them!

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:07.840
I expected this.

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.770
The Bagra Army has arrived already.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.060
What should we do?

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.900
Go back to Taiki and the others?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.670
No, if Akari and Zenjirou run 
into them, there'll be trouble.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.110
We have to find them, quick!

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:17.720
Hold up!

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.420
These are Beelzebumon's feathers.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.110
They're not far from here.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.630
Being the ones to stay 
behind was a mistake!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:27.750
What do we do, Taiki?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.320
Dorulumon is not here.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.450
We can't become X4.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:34.650
We'll have to fight back with 
X2 and some extra members!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.030
Shoutmon!

00:09:38.030 --> 00:09:39.520
Okay!

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.830
Ballistamon!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.700
DigiXros!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.300
DigiXros!

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.470
Shoutmon X2!

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:56.430
Reload, Knightmon!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.870
PawnChessmons!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:01.750
I'm counting on you guys!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.960
Taiki's here, too?

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.920
You saved me before,

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:15.660
but please don't interfere 
in this Zone's battle.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.460
Pass the message on to Taiki.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.860
Bye bye!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.210
Tremendous power, as usual.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.740
Hey, look there!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.910
We found them! Let's go!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.520
Who is that?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.490
You're...

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.390
Tactimon!

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.030
Kongoumon.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:51.030
Y-Yes, Lord Tactimon!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.600
I considered punishing you severely

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.990
for your ineptitude in 
invading the Forest Zone,

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.840
but now that the three humans 
with Xros Loaders are here,

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.880
I see that it can't be helped.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:03.040
Yes, you are right, Sir...

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.000
<i>I can't tell him now</i>

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.980
<i>that it's Stingmon who's 
been giving us trouble...</i>

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.720
<i>Nene and Kiriha are here, too?</i>

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:14.310
I will handle this boy.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.530
You go to the War Cry Forest as planned,

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.600
and get the Code Crown

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:23.090
and its keeper, the strongest 
Digimon in the Zone.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.000
Understood, sir!

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:29.670
The Code Crown and the 
strongest Digimon?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.220
That's what you guys are after?!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:37.560
There is no need for you 
to know, boy of the red.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.950
So, shall we begin?

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:51.250
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.740
They may be made up of data,

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:58.630
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.700
Join us in our world of adventure

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.270
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:05.340
DigiXros!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:32.580
You'll be safe here.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.490
But are you sure it's all right?

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.290
Isn't this place supposed 
to be off-limits?

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.590
I'm sorry.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:41.000
The Bagra Army's attacks 
have been so nasty lately,

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.840
Stingmon's been really tense.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:46.100
You were able to come as 
far as this sacred shrine

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.790
protected by a barrier that our 
guardian deity placed on it.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:52.670
You possess clean hearts 
filled with love,

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.140
so you'll be fine.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.360
Me... too?

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.680
We're soldiers of love!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.320
You must never let go of his hand!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:04.620
I told you, we're not like that!

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:09.190
Aww, you're being shy. 
How cute! So innocent!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.870
I apologize for attacking you.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.910
It is my duty to protect the sacred

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.410
Digimon housed deep within this shrine.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:19.460
Stay here for a while.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.100
I guess he's not a bad Digimon.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:25.690
Actually, he seems more like 
a victim of the Bagra Army.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:28.080
Hey, you guys!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.150
Oh, Dorulumon!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.020
Is that...

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:33.280
Ballistamon's signal flare?

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.650
Taiki and the others are in danger!

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.260
We have to get back there, fast!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.590
If you have more friends, 
you should bring them here.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:45.350
Y-Yeah! Apparently bad guys 
can't get into this place!

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.830
Besides, the Bagra 
Army is targeting him.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.650
We have to protect him, too!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.750
Thank you.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.980
You really are soldiers of love!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.040
Don't squish us together!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.850
All right. Look after 
Cutemon, soldiers of love.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.080
Let's go.

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:05.290
We'll bring Taiki and the others back!

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:08.890
Don't leave with that misunderstanding!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:13.620
I really wanna go back 
to our own world...

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.790
Now, let us cut down the Bagra Army.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:22.710
Relax. The Bagra Army won't be coming.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.940
Someone even worse is here, though.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.220
Kiriha!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:32.780
N-Nene!

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.820
DigiXros.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.680
You will not grow any further.

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:44.860
It's over!

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.130
Is it really?

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.960
Dorulumon, why you...!

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:52.960
Guys!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:57.270
Taiki, let's show him how strong we are now!

00:15:57.270 --> 00:15:57.840
Yeah!

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:01.740
Shoutmon X2!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:02.920
Oh yeah!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.210
Dorulumon!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.940
Beelzebumon!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.280
Starmons!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.660
Yes!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.320
DigiXros!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.920
DigiXros!

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.720
Shoutmon X4B!

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:31.490
<i>Another new DigiXros?</i>

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:34.240
Time for our counterattack, 
you armored creep!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.970
Behold our power!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.610
<i>They are...</i>

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.070
Lilamon!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.200
Please, stop!

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.260
Th-That's right!

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:56.660
What you're doing is no 
different from the Bagra Army!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.870
H-He's right.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.520
Maybe I've gone a little too far...

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.270
Maybe...

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.560
I didn't expect this.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:19.590
To continue this fight,

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:23.500
I would need Lord Bagramon to 
remove the seal from this sword.

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:27.680
I never thought an enemy that 
formidable would show up.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:32.030
What are you mumbling about?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.160
Now I have more to look forward to.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.230
We'll meet again, red team.

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:38.480
Listen up and make sure you remember!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:41.460
Our team's name is Xros Heart!

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.920
Xros Heart, eh? Understood.

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.210
I'll remember that.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:51.020
Chaos Flare!

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:02.860
Taiki! Akari and Zenjirou are safe!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.200
Thank goodness!

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:07.640
This is awful!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.400
And they're not even bad Digimon!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.040
Please stop this already, Kiriha!

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:16.030
You're right. I've won this battle.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.430
No, Kiriha.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.480
You can't stop attacking.

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.990
They still haven't given us

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.350
information about the legendary Digimon.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:28.380
You want me to torture it out of them?

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:30.620
Good idea. Please do.

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:33.660
Nene is kind of scary today...

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.400
She's in a bad mood.

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.260
Acutely bad!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.080
We're so close...

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.370
So close to...

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.950
Cooperate with me, Kiriha.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.050
I've chosen you for that purpose.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:49.310
Not the kind Taiki, but you, 
who's cold as ice.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.610
I decline.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.250
I only seek to fight strong opponents.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.900
I have no interest in 
someone who has lost.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:09.640
You shouldn't be so 
fickle, Kiriha Aonuma.

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:13.060
Don't give my dear Nene problems.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.760
Wait, DarkKnightmon!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:16.650
I'll persuade him myself!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.410
Don't Reload without my permission!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:25.050
It's that scary Digimon from before!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.810
DarkKnightmon?!

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:30.830
If you are only interested 
in strong opponents,

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:34.320
perhaps you will be satisfied if 
I make you surrender by force!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.720
A-Allies fighting each other?

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.590
Do as I say.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.390
You... will pay for that!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.930
Wrong answer.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.270
Taiki!

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.100
Aren't you guys partners?!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.540
What are you doing?!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.670
I must...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.930
protect Lilamon...

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.220
and all the others...

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:16.090
Soldier of deep love, 
I shall save your life.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:20.830
Our guardian deity has called Stingmon!

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.350
Perfect opportunity.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.910
We, Team Twilight,

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:38.750
will take the sacred, strongest 
Digimon in the Zone.

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.480
That scary guy took 
my idol, Nene, away!

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.760
What do we do?!

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:52.230
Team... Twilight?

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.600
<b>To Be Continued</b>

