00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Angel Type</b>

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:14.480
<b>Grand Cross</b>

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.490
Ah, take me to heaven!

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:20.540
DarkKnightmon is taking 
Deckerdramon for himself!

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:22.190
What is the secret of 
the sacred Deckerdramon,

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:25.100
and what is his surprising ability?

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.860
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.320
<b>The Legendary Deckerdramon Stirs!</b>

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.370
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
